I built an AI Fake News Detection system using RAG architecture.
It processes text using NLP, converts it into embeddings using
transformer models, stores them in FAISS, retrieves relevant trusted information,
and uses an LLM to classify news as fake or real with explanations and confidence scores.

workflow of the project
-----------------------
User inputs news
Text preprocessing (NLP)
Text → chunks
Chunks → embeddings (Transformers)
Stored in FAISS
Retriever fetches relevant info
LLM analyzes and generates:
Fake/Real
Explanation
Confidence


